---
import ServiceLayout from '../layouts/ServiceLayout.astro';

const schemaData = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Service",
    "name": "GEO Agency for Enrichment Centres Singapore",
    "description": "GEO and AI search optimisation agency for enrichment centres in Singapore. Get your programmes named when parents ask ChatGPT, Gemini and Google AI Mode which enrichment class suits their child.",
    "provider": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Jraft Creative",
      "url": "https://jraftcreative.com/",
      "logo": "https://jraftcreative.com/images/logo.png",
      "telephone": "+6582234578",
      "address": {
        "@type": "PostalAddress",
        "streetAddress": "60 Paya Lebar Road, Paya Lebar Square",
        "postalCode": "409051",
        "addressLocality": "Singapore",
        "addressCountry": "SG"
      }
    },
    "areaServed": { "@type": "Country", "name": "Singapore" },
    "serviceType": "Enrichment Centre AI Search Optimisation"
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "What is GEO for an enrichment centre?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Generative Engine Optimisation is the work of getting your centre named when a parent asks an AI assistant instead of searching Google. Ask ChatGPT which enrichment class suits a six-year-old who struggles to sit still, and you get two or three suggestions rather than a page of results. GEO is about being one of them, which depends on signals traditional SEO largely ignores." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Our programmes have their own names. Is that a problem?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "It is, if the branded name is all that appears. Parents do not search for a trademarked curriculum \u2014 they search for the outcome they want for their child. Unless your programme is explicitly connected to plain-language outcomes and age bands, an assistant has no way to match it to what a parent actually asked." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Everyone in enrichment claims confidence and creativity. How do we stand out?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "By replacing adjectives with evidence. Showcase performances, competition results, teacher qualifications and specific class formats are checkable; holistic development is not. AI systems weight corroborated specifics, so the centres that state concrete things are the ones that get named." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Can you show whether it is working?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. We track prompts a real parent would use \u2014 by outcome, age band and neighbourhood \u2014 across ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity and Google AI Mode, then re-run them monthly. You get a baseline and a movement report per programme, including how your centre is described when it does appear." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Is it too early for enrichment centres to invest in this?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "It is early, which is the argument for moving now. Enrichment is fiercely contested on Google, where the established chains have spent years building authority. AI search is the one surface where that head start counts for much less \u2014 and almost nobody in the category has structured their data for it yet." } }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://jraftcreative.com/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "GEO Agency for Enrichment Centres Singapore", "item": "https://jraftcreative.com/enrichment-centre-ai-search-optimisation-singapore/" }
    ]
  }
];
---

<style is:global>
  /* Hide the global background grid pattern on this page only */
  .animated-bg__grid { display: none; }

  /* More-prominent related-service pills — match challenge-card-v2 green treatment */
  #related-services .related-service-link {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.14) 0%, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.06) 100%), rgba(20, 28, 32, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.35);
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease, background 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
  }
  #related-services .related-service-link:hover {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.22) 0%, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.1) 100%), rgba(20, 28, 32, 0.7);
    border-color: rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.6);
    color: var(--accent);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -8px rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.3);
  }

  /* Separate the CTA section from related-services with bg-alt */
  .service-cta-section {
    background: var(--bg-alt) !important;
  }

  /* Enrolment Funnel — 5-stage horizontal flow with green accents */
  .renovation-funnel {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 56px 0 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    gap: 48px;
    counter-reset: funnel;
  }
  .funnel-stage {
    position: relative;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 28px 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.14) 0%, rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.06) 100%), rgba(20, 28, 32, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.28);
    border-radius: 12px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }
  .funnel-stage:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.55);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px -16px rgba(73, 184, 137, 0.3);
  }
  .funnel-stage h3 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .funnel-stage p {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .funnel-stage:not(:last-child)::after {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    right: -34px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    z-index: 2;
    line-height: 1;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .renovation-funnel {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .funnel-stage:nth-child(2n)::after,
    .funnel-stage:last-child::after {
      display: none;
    }
    .funnel-stage:nth-child(2n-1)::after {
      right: -22px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .renovation-funnel {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .funnel-stage::after {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<ServiceLayout
  title="GEO Agency for Enrichment Centres Singapore"
  description="GEO agency for enrichment centres in Singapore — get named when parents ask ChatGPT and Gemini which enrichment class suits their child."
  canonical="https://jraftcreative.com/enrichment-centre-ai-search-optimisation-singapore/"
  ogTitle="GEO Agency for Enrichment Centres Singapore"
  ogDescription="AI search optimisation for Singapore enrichment centres. Get named when parents ask ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity."
  ogImage="https://jraftcreative.com/images/og-webdev.jpg"
  keywords="geo agency for enrichment centres, enrichment centre ai search optimisation singapore, ai search optimisation for enrichment, enrichment centre chatgpt optimisation, generative engine optimisation enrichment singapore, Jraft Creative"
  schemaData={schemaData}
  heroLabel="GEO Agency for Enrichment Centres"
  heroTitle='GEO Agency for <span class="highlight">Enrichment Centres in Singapore</span>'
  heroSubtitle="Enrichment is the most crowded shelf in Singapore education — speech and drama, coding, abacus, art, robotics. When a parent asks an AI which class suits their child, it names two or three centres. Being one of them is the whole game."
  heroImage="/images/service-enrichment.webp"
  heroImageAlt="Enrichment class in Singapore — enrichment centre AI search optimisation"
  heroButtons={[
    { text: "Get an AI Visibility Audit", href: "/contact/", class: "btn btn-primary" },
    { text: "See Enrichment Centre SEO", href: "/enrichment-centre-seo-singapore/", class: "btn btn-secondary" }
  ]}
  whatsappText="Hi Jraft Creative, I'd like to know if my enrichment centre shows up in AI search."
  ctaLabel="Be the Answer"
  ctaTitle="Find Out What AI Says About Your Enrichment Centre"
  ctaDescription="Book a free consultation and we'll run the questions a real parent would ask — by programme, age group and neighbourhood — across ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity, and show you where each of your programmes currently stands. We'll get back to you within 24 hours."
  ctaButtons={[
    { text: "Get an AI Visibility Audit", href: "/contact/", class: "btn btn-primary" },
    { text: "Chat on WhatsApp", href: "https://wa.me/6582234578?text=Hi%20Jraft%20Creative%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20know%20if%20my%20enrichment%20centre%20shows%20up%20in%20AI%20search.", class: "btn btn-secondary" }
  ]}
  hideDefaultCta={false}
>

  <!-- ========== THE CHALLENGE ========== -->
  <section class="section" id="challenge" aria-label="AI search challenges for enrichment centres in Singapore">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">The Challenge</p>
        <h2>Parents Ask by <span class="highlight">Outcome</span>. You Answer with a <span class="highlight">Programme Name</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content reveal">
        <p>Enrichment is the most crowded shelf in Singapore education — and the hardest category for a machine to tell apart.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-details-grid challenge-grid-v2" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));">
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d1">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Nobody Searches Your Curriculum Name</h3>
            <p>Parents ask for "a class for a shy six-year-old", not for your trademarked programme. If only the brand name is indexed, nothing matches.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d2">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Every Centre Claims the Same Thing</h3>
            <p>Confidence, creativity, holistic development. When a hundred centres say it identically, none of it helps an assistant choose between you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d3">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Age Bands Left Vague</h3>
            <p>"Suitable for all ages" is unusable. A parent asking about a K1 child needs a centre that states K1 plainly, and gets one.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== WHAT WE DELIVER ========== -->
  <section class="section" id="sub-services" style="background: var(--bg-alt);" aria-label="GEO services for enrichment centres">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">What We Deliver</p>
        <h2>Six <span class="highlight">GEO Workstreams</span> for <span class="highlight">Enrichment Centres</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content reveal">
        <p>We translate what your programme does for a child into the language parents actually use when they ask.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-details-grid deliver-grid">
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d1" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-seo-audit.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>AI Visibility Audit</h3>
            <p>We ask what parents ask — by outcome, age and estate — across ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity, and record where you appear.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d2" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-onpage-seo.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Outcome-to-Programme Mapping</h3>
            <p>Your proprietary programme names connected to the plain outcomes parents search for — speech confidence, focus, early coding.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d3" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-content-strategy.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Age Band &amp; Level Entities</h3>
            <p>N2, K1, K2, lower primary — stated as structured facts, including class size, duration and whether trials are offered.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d1" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-local-seo.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Per-Branch Location Data</h3>
            <p>Each centre as its own entity, so a weekend-class question in one estate doesn't hand the answer to a competitor.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d2" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-ai.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Evidence Over Adjectives</h3>
            <p>Showcases, competition results and teacher credentials corroborated elsewhere — the things that survive an assistant's fact-check.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 deliver-card-with-bg reveal reveal-d3" style="background-image: url('/images/detail-campaign-analytics.webp');">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Prompt Monitoring by Programme</h3>
            <p>Tracked prompts per programme and age band, re-run monthly, so you see which classes are visible and which are invisible.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== WHY US ========== -->
  <section class="section" id="why-us" aria-label="Why choose Jraft Creative as your enrichment centre GEO agency">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">Why Jraft Creative</p>
        <h2>A <span class="highlight">GEO Agency</span> That Has Been <span class="highlight">Cited Itself</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content reveal">
        <p>We run this on our own site and publish the method rather than treating it as a black box.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-details-grid challenge-grid-v2" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));">
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d1">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>We've Earned AI Citations</h3>
            <p>We wrote up <a href="/blog/how-we-got-cited-in-google-ai-overview-singapore/">how we got cited in Google's AI Overview</a> for niche Singapore queries — method, not marketing.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d2">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>We Already Run Enrichment Search</h3>
            <p>We handle <a href="/enrichment-centre-seo-singapore/">enrichment SEO</a> and <a href="/enrichment-centre-marketing-singapore/">marketing</a> here, so we know which parent questions precede a trial booking.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-detail-card challenge-card-v2 reveal reveal-d3">
          <div class="service-detail-card__content">
            <h3>Measured, Not Claimed</h3>
            <p>Baseline first, monthly re-runs after. If a programme's visibility hasn't moved, the report says so — see our <a href="/education-ai-search-optimisation-singapore/">education GEO programme</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== ENROLMENT FUNNEL ========== -->
  <section class="section" id="buyer-funnel" style="background: var(--bg-alt);" aria-label="Where AI search fits the enrichment parent journey">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">The Enrolment Funnel</p>
        <h2>Where <span class="highlight">AI Search</span> Fits the <span class="highlight">Parent Journey</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="section-content reveal" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
        <p>Enrichment is a discretionary spend, so parents start from a problem rather than a product — a child who won't focus, or one ready for more. AI now takes that problem and returns a shortlist before you know the family exists.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="renovation-funnel reveal">
        <li class="funnel-stage">
          <h3>Ask</h3>
          <p>A parent describes the child, not the class</p>
        </li>
        <li class="funnel-stage">
          <h3>Shortlist</h3>
          <p>Two or three centres get named — or you don't</p>
        </li>
        <li class="funnel-stage">
          <h3>Validate</h3>
          <p>Showcases, teachers and parent reviews</p>
        </li>
        <li class="funnel-stage">
          <h3>Trial</h3>
          <p>A trial class, still the deciding moment</p>
        </li>
        <li class="funnel-stage">
          <h3>Enrol</h3>
          <p>Sign for the term, renew &amp; refer</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ========== FAQ ========== -->
  <section class="section faq-section" id="faq" style="background: var(--bg-alt);" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about GEO for enrichment centres">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">FAQ</p>
        <h2>GEO for <span class="highlight">Enrichment Centres</span> — Questions Answered</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item reveal reveal-d1">
          <summary>What is GEO for an enrichment centre?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Generative Engine Optimisation is the work of getting your centre named when a parent asks an AI assistant instead of searching Google. Ask ChatGPT which enrichment class suits a six-year-old who struggles to sit still, and you get two or three suggestions rather than a page of results. GEO is about being one of them, which depends on signals traditional SEO largely ignores.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item reveal reveal-d2">
          <summary>Our programmes have their own names. Is that a problem?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>It is, if the branded name is all that appears. Parents don't search for a trademarked curriculum — they search for the outcome they want for their child. Unless your programme is explicitly connected to plain-language outcomes and age bands, an assistant has no way to match it to what a parent actually asked.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item reveal reveal-d3">
          <summary>Everyone in enrichment claims confidence and creativity. How do we stand out?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>By replacing adjectives with evidence. Showcase performances, competition results, teacher qualifications and specific class formats are checkable; "holistic development" is not. AI systems weight corroborated specifics, so the centres that state concrete things are the ones that get named.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item reveal reveal-d1">
          <summary>Can you show whether it is working?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. We track prompts a real parent would use — by outcome, age band and neighbourhood — across ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity and Google AI Mode, then re-run them monthly. You get a baseline and a movement report per programme, including how your centre is described when it does appear.</p></div>
        </details>
        <details class="faq-item reveal reveal-d2">
          <summary>Is it too early for enrichment centres to invest in this?</summary>
          <div class="faq-answer"><p>It's early, which is the argument for moving now. Enrichment is fiercely contested on Google, where the established chains have spent years building authority. AI search is the one surface where that head start counts for much less — and almost nobody in the category has structured their data for it yet.</p></div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Related Services -->
  <section class="section" id="related-services" aria-label="Related services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header reveal">
        <p class="section-label">Explore More</p>
        <h2>More <span class="highlight">Enrichment Centre</span> Services</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="related-services-grid reveal">
          <a href="/enrichment-centre-seo-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Enrichment Centre SEO</a>
          <a href="/enrichment-centre-website-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Enrichment Centre Website</a>
          <a href="/enrichment-centre-google-ads-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Enrichment Centre Google Ads</a>
          <a href="/enrichment-centre-social-media-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Enrichment Centre Social Media</a>
          <a href="/enrichment-centre-branding-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Enrichment Centre Branding</a>
          <a href="/enrichment-centre-marketing-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Full-Service Enrichment Marketing</a>
          <a href="/education-ai-search-optimisation-singapore/" class="related-service-link">Education GEO / AI Search</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</ServiceLayout>
